<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T5.15" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:129%;">Table 5</span>: </span><span id="S4.T5.16" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:129%;">Comparison of prediction delay (AEDT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib19" title="" class="ltx_ref">19</a>]</cite>) and F1 (loc.) between SDVC <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib55" title="" class="ltx_ref">55</a>]</cite> and OpenHOUSE in EgoGS <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib37" title="" class="ltx_ref">37</a>]</cite>. The numbers 70 and 105 denote the decoding points interval of SDVC.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
